      "message": "I\u0027m suggesting to drop the words \"Please note that\", as it\u0027s superfluous.\n\nDHGEX-sha256: I don\u0027t know. it\u0027s essentially the same as diffie-hellman-group16-sha512, so if that is secure, DHGEX is too?",
